# a format 21 project, from before knit's Osc 2 page (format 22: TP_O2WAVE and TP_O2SHAPE after TP_RUP), and its
# presets (format 11: a user preset without osc 2's wave, the user kits after the presets): saved by that build, for
# the migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). Track 3 knit with osc 2 at +7 and level 90, fine +20 cents, saved
# as user preset U1; track 1's kit, its key 2 on model 12, saved as user kit K8.
# Run by a format 21 build (d1de146): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v21.xy OUT
wait 300
bpm 103
param 3 engine knit
param 3 e1 40
param 3 x1 71
param 3 x2 90
param 3 fine 84
wait 40
usersave 3 1
spin ALGO -2
expect trk 1
param 1 d2.model 12
listen
tap EDIT
tap SEL
row SAVE KIT
turn ALGO 7
wait 300
said K8 (empty)
tap SEL
wait 40
said KIT SAVED
projsave 1 v21_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v21.bin
